//! What differs between the protocol versions this codec speaks.
//!
//! One codec serves every release from 1.21.11 on. Each release is a
//! [`Version`]: its packet ids (by name, from the game's own `packets.json`),
//! the tables that translate the engine's ids into its own, how it receives
//! its registries, and a [`Gen`] for the handful of places where a packet's
//! *layout* changed rather than its id. The tables are generated by
//! `tools/gen/versions.py`; the layout differences are written out in the
//! codec, each with the release that introduced it.

use aether_world::BlockStateId;

use crate::protocol::nbt::Nbt;

